[h2]Shooting Training[/h2]
Choose your gear in the Virtual Arsenal and close it to start. The scenario moves you through six firing positions. At each one, a group of AI targets walks across your line of sight. The score counts the targets you hit fatally.

You stay at the firing position and have unlimited ammunition. Ammunition is replenished after you fire, including compatible secondary muzzles. Damage, fatigue and stamina are disabled for the player. Press [b]F1[/b] for earplugs or [b]Ctrl+F1[/b] for their settings.

[h2]Start the scenario[/h2]
Open Training from the single-player Scenarios menu.

